        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-856, Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA fantastic example of old world beauty, the Lines and Crosses features the ever popular Ribbon and Reed design that is iconic of French Colonial decor. This RK International made cabinet pull is available in 3 lengths: 3 inches, 5 inches, and 8 inches. The 6 available finishes means that you will be sure to find just the right one to match your style. The French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Door Pull is packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/crossed-indian-drum-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-757\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/ornate-edge-cabinet-pull-rosette-rk-international-bp-384\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull Rosette</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-12-inch-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4857\"><b>12\" Ribbon and Reed Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-856 Lines and Crosses Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-856</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-857</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-858</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
